---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /tactics/
title: "Táticas de CS2 por mapa - Mirage, Inferno, Nuke e mais | CSTatics Brasil"
description: "Selecione um mapa e acesse lineups, execuções e defesas de Counter-Strike 2: Mirage, Inferno, Dust2, Nuke, Ancient e Anubis."
---

<section class="maps-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Arsenal por mapa</span>
        <h1 class="section-head__title">Selecione o mapa</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="section-head__rule"></div>
      <span class="maps-count datum">{{ maps.maps | filterBy("active", true) | length }} no pool ativo</span>
    </div>

    <div class="maps-grid">
      {% for map in maps.maps %}
        <a href="/mapas/{{ map.slug }}/" class="map-card hud {% if not map.active %}map-card--legacy{% endif %}" data-reveal>
          <i class="hud-brackets" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <div class="scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <div class="map-card__image">
            <img src="{{ map.logo }}" alt="Mapa {{ map.name }} do CS2" loading="lazy">
          </div>

          <div class="map-card__body">
            <span class="map-card__name">{{ map.name }}</span>
            <span class="map-card__meta datum">
              {% if map.active %}Pool ativo{% else %}Legado{% endif %}
            </span>
          </div>

          <span class="map-card__go datum">Abrir →</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .maps-section { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 0 clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem); }

  .maps-count {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .maps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(210px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .map-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .map-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); }

  .map-card__image {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(61, 139, 255, 0.08), transparent 65%);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  /* Insígnia monocromática: inverte o logo (fundo branco → preto) e o
     blend "screen" faz o preto desaparecer sobre o painel escuro. */
  .map-card__image img {
    width: 76%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: grayscale(1) invert(1) contrast(1.18) brightness(1.05);
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
    opacity: 0.82;
    transition: transform var(--transition-slow), opacity var(--transition-normal), filter var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .map-card:hover .map-card__image img {
    transform: scale(1.06);
    opacity: 1;
    filter: grayscale(1) invert(1) contrast(1.25) brightness(1.15);
  }

  .map-card__body {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .map-card__name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .map-card__meta {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .map-card--legacy .map-card__meta { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .map-card--legacy .map-card__image img { opacity: 0.45; }

  .map-card__go {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: color var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .map-card:hover .map-card__go { color: var(--color-primary); }
</style>
